<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi's Ahsa Development Co nine-month net falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi's Ahsa Development Co nine-month net falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit		10.2    vs   12.8</p>
<p> Revenue		   12.0    vs   14.4</p>
<p> Expenditure		1.8    vs    1.6</p>
<p> Shareholders funds   345.6    vs  332.3</p>
<p>Full name: Al-Ahsa Development Company.</p>
<p>Note - Saudi's industrial giant Saudi Basic Industries Corp holds a 10 percent stake in the company while Saudi and other Gulf Arab investors own the rest.</p>
</text>
